[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Structured outputs that keep content summaries separate from provenance metadata—such as URLs, document names, and page numbers—preserve traceability across summarization stages. The report generator can then associate factual claims with their original sources and produce accurate citations.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
