[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A spawned synthesis subagent needs the relevant research outputs supplied explicitly in its task context. Including the complete findings from the web-search and document-analysis subagents in its prompt gives it all of the evidence required to synthesize them; context from the coordinator is not implicitly inherited in full.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
