[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A meaningful confirmation must present the action’s material parameters so the user can verify them before approving: the full post content, target account, scheduled time, and platform. This makes confirmation an informed review of the irreversible or consequential action rather than a reflexive acknowledgment.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
